{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55794","headline":"酬韦二十二行次见寄 · 翁承赞","name":"酬韦二十二行次见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独触离肠雪满襟，晚来惆怅两难任。\n早知上马同千里，且合携觞更一斟。\n曩眷已坚金石志，新诗重壮岁寒心。\n他时挂壁尘冠在，不爲闲人取次寻。\n（影印本《诗渊》第二册第八七三页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}